Trembling Kausalyā begs ride to Daṇḍaka --- Kausalyā threatens death without exiles --- Sumantra bids her abandon grief --- Lakṣmaṇa wins heaven serving Rāma feet --- Fearless Sītā feels at home in forest --- Sītā enjoys road villages rivers trees --- Heat dims not moonlike Sītā splendor --- Clinging Rāma arms Sītā fears no beasts --- Exiles guard father promise on sage path --- Kausalyā wails still despite consolation